<section class="en" lang="en" dir="ltr">
<h2>Privacy Policy (English)</h2>
<p>Workout Log («سجل التمارين») works fully offline. It does not collect, store on any server, or share any personal data. There are no ads, analytics, tracking or accounts. Everything you enter (workouts, weights, nutrition profile, body-weight log) stays in a local database on your device. Backup/CSV export files are created on your device and sent only where you choose through the system share sheet. Deleting the app deletes all of its data. Nutrition figures are estimates, not medical advice.</p>
<p>Contact: <a href="mailto:najeeb@turkieshop.com">najeeb@turkieshop.com</a></p>
</section>

